  "prefLabel": "Ph 103.02 Officers",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ph 103.02 Officers. Annually, in September, the board members shall elect, from among their number, a president, a vice president, a secretary and a treasurer.\n\nSource. #6181-A, eff 2-5-96",
